            {
              "label": "Sign up",
              "href": "/sign-up-ac56"
            }
          ],
          "current": "Review changes before anyone depends on them"
        },
        "tag": "Guide",
        "title": "Join the conversation",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "kind": "h3",
            "text": "Teams use one shared workspace so plans, checks and reviews stay in step."
          },
          {
            "kind": "p",
            "text": "Clear ownership keeps handoffs short and questions easy to route."
          },
          {
            "kind": "p",
            "text": "Plain defaults get a new project running in an afternoon instead of a quarter. Reviewers see the same preview that readers will see, so surprises stay rare. Built-in checks run on every change and report problems in words people can act on. Wrenly keeps a readable history, so you can always see who changed what and why. Work moves forward without waiting on a single gatekeeper or a long approval chain."
          },
          {
            "kind": "p",
            "text": "Small teams and large ones use the same tools, tuned to how each group already works. Share a finished result with a colleague in one step and keep editing your own copy."
          },
          {
            "kind": "accordion",
            "items": [
              {
                "q": "See how it works",
                "blocks": [
                  {
                    "kind": "p",
                    "text": "Plan a visit"
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "ul",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "You decide what is public, what is internal and what stays in draft."
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Each project carries its own notes, owners and a short list of things still to do."
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Fewer meetings are needed when everyone can open the same page and see the same facts."
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "A quiet dashboard beats a loud one, so alerts only fire when somebody needs to act."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "kind": "img",
            "image": {
              "assetRole": "photo.generated-scene",
              "alt": "Smiling team gathered around a shared screen",
              "ref": "generate:generated-scene-1"
            }
          }
        ],
        "form": {
          "anchor": "register",
          "fields": [
            {
              "name": "firstname",
              "label": "Explore options",
              "type": "text",
              "required": true,
              "autoComplete": "given-name"
            },
            {
              "name": "lastname",
              "label": "See pricing",
              "type": "text",
              "required": true,
              "autoComplete": "family-name"
            },
            {
              "name": "email",
              "label": "Contact sales",
              "type": "email",
              "required": true,
              "autoComplete": "email"
            },
            {
              "name": "company",
              "label": "Browse all",
              "type": "text",
              "required": true,
              "autoComplete": "organization"
            },
            {
              "name": "role",
              "label": "See how it works",
              "type": "select",
              "required": true,
              "placeholder": "Choose one",
              "options": [
                "Health care",
                "Founder or owner",
                "Something else",
                "Student or teacher",
                "Marketing lead",
                "Support specialist"
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "phone",
              "label": "View details",
              "type": "tel",
              "autoComplete": "tel"
            }
          ],
          "submit": "Explore options",
          "consent": "Our support group answers most questions within a working day and follows up until they are solved. Move between drafts, previews and published pages without losing your place. Clear ownership keeps handoffs short and questions easy to route.",
          "success": "Reports refresh on a schedule you set, and the schedule is visible to everyone who reads them."
        }
      },
